    <string name="info">About ApkScope</string>
    <string name="info_message">ApkScope shows how every installed app is built: versions, SDK levels, APK files and splits, native libraries, signing certificates, permissions and manifest components.\n\nIt has no Internet permission, no analytics and no storage permission. Nothing leaves your phone unless you share or save it yourself.\n\nLong press any value to copy it.</string>
